  unitName: Inferno Revolution Ruby
  unitId: 10647
  unitNumber: 1696
  description: Ruby sustained injuries that most certainly could be considered fatal
    in the course of saving the Oracle Knight's life during a heated battle. The
    odds that she survived are incredibly slim. However, if she had survived, she
    likely would have rushed to rejoin the knight on his quest to end the war between
    humanity and the gods. Had he only seen her radiant smile, the Oracle Knight
    might have come back from the edge of utter despair and risked his life for the
    hope of a better future.
  summonDesc: I'm absolutely not going to vanish! I'll follow him forever!
  fusionDesc: All for him...<br>I'll get as strong as you want!<br>Huh? Are you jealous
    of us?
  evoDesc: This is my biggest upgrade!<br>I'll show you!<br>Oh, but don't tell anybody,
    okay?
